    40	## 2. 错误分类法速查
    41	
    42	### 2.1 完整分类表
    43	
    44	| 类别         | 编码前缀      | 包含子类                                                     | 诊断优先顺序          |
    45	| ------------ | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |
    46	| 语法错误     | `syntax`      | `sql_syntax_error`, `invalid_alias`                          | **1st**（最容易检测） |
    47	| Schema 链接  | `schema_link` | `table_missing`, `col_missing`, `ambiguous_col`, `incorrect_foreign_key` | **2nd**               |
    48	| Join 错误    | `join`        | `join_missing`, `join_wrong_type`, `extra_table`, `incorrect_col` | **3rd**               |
    49	| 过滤错误     | `filter`      | `where_missing`, `condition_wrong_col`, `condition_type_mismatch` | **4th**               |
    50	| 聚合错误     | `aggregation` | `agg_no_groupby`, `groupby_missing_col`, `having_without_groupby`, `having_incorrect`, `having_vs_where` | **5th**               |
    51	| 值错误       | `value`       | `hardcoded_value`, `value_format_wrong`                      | **6th**               |
    52	| 子查询错误   | `subquery`    | `unused_subquery`, `subquery_missing`, `subquery_correlation_error` | **7th**               |
    53	| 集合操作错误 | `set_ops`     | `union_missing`, `intersect_missing`, `except_missing`       | **8th**               |
    54	| 其他问题     | `other`       | `order_by_missing`, `limit_missing`, `duplicate_select`, `unsupported_function`, `extra_values_selected` | **9th**               |
